cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "MedLite: offline drug-interaction lookup with database-grounded, guarded summaries"
abstract: >-
  An offline drug-interaction lookup over DDInter with file-level provenance,
  confirm-before-use spelling suggestions, pair-by-pair results that never present a
  missing record as safe, and optional local-model summaries behind an output
  guardrail. Information tool only; not medical advice.
authors:
  - family-names: Gupta
    given-names: Kushagra
    affiliation: Vellore Institute of Technology
repository-code: "https://github.com/kushagragupta2005/MedLite"
license: MIT
date-released: "2026-10-16"
keywords:
  - drug-drug interactions
  - pharmacovigilance
  - health informatics
  - named entity recognition
  - LLM guardrails
  - sqlite
